<div class="traveller-info">
  <h2>Travelling to Japan?</h2>
  <div class="travel-grid">
    <div class="travel-item"><strong>Driving side:</strong> Left</div>
    <div class="travel-item"><strong>Emergency number:</strong> 110 (police) / 119 (fire &amp; ambulance)</div>
    <div class="travel-item"><strong>Calling from abroad:</strong> +81 then the local number</div>
  </div>
  <p>Before you fly, run through a free <a href="https://247packinglist.com" rel="noopener">packing checklist for Japan</a>. Pack a <a href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=universal+travel+adapter&tag=simpledrills-20" class="amz-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener">universal travel adapter</a> for your devices. You can also <a href="https://247sizing.com" rel="noopener">check clothing and shoe sizes in Japan</a> before you shop, and <a href="https://247caloriecheck.com" rel="noopener">look up popular foods from Japan</a> if you want to know what's on the menu.</p>
  <p>Leaving your car at a UK airport? <a href="https://www.awin1.com/cread.php?awinmid=3494&awinaffid=2886575&clickref=countryinfo_context&ued=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.airparks.co.uk%2F%3Fagent%3DWX425" class="awin-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener">Compare off-airport parking with Airparks</a> before you fly to Japan.
