<div class="faq-section">
  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions about Japan</h2>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>What is the capital and currency of Japan?</h3><p>The capital of Japan is Tokyo and the currency is the Japanese yen (JPY), symbol ¥.</p></div>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>What is the capital of Japan?</h3><p>The capital of Japan is Tokyo.</p></div>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>What currency does Japan use?</h3><p>Japan uses the Japanese yen (JPY, symbol: ¥).</p></div>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>What language do they speak in Japan?</h3><p>The official language of Japan is Japanese.</p></div>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>What is the dialling code for Japan?</h3><p>The international dialling code for Japan is +81.</p></div>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>What side of the road does Japan drive on?</h3><p>Japan drives on the left-hand side of the road.</p></div>
</div>



